#. module: website_sale_renting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_renting/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your rental duration was too short. Unfortunately, we do not "
"process\n"
"                rentals that last less than %(duration)s %(unit)s.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                مدت زمان مورد نظر شما برای اجاره بسیار کوتاه است. متاسفانه "
"اجاره‌هایی که\n"
"                کمتر از %(duration)s %(unit)s باشند قابل پردازش نیستند.\n"
"            "

#. module: website_sale_renting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_renting/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your rental product had invalid date of pickup (%"
"(start_date)s).\n"
"                Unfortunately, we do not process pickups on that weekday.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"تاریخ شروع اجاره محصول (%(start_date)s) معتبر نیست.\n"
" متأسفانه ما در آن روز از هفته تحویل‌های اجاره را پردازش نمی‌کنیم.\n"
"            "

#. module: website_sale_renting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_renting/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your rental product had invalid date of return (%"
"(end_date)s).\n"
"                Unfortunately, we do not process returns on that weekday.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"تاریخ برگشت اجاره محصول (%(end_date)s) معتبر نیست.\n"
" متأسفانه ما در آن روز از هفته برگشت‌های اجاره را پردازش نمی‌کنیم.\n"
"            "

#. module: website_sale_renting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_renting/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your rental product had invalid dates of pickup (%"
"(start_date)s) and\n"
"                return (%(end_date)s). Unfortunately, we do not process "
"pickups nor\n"
"                returns on those weekdays.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"تاریخ برداشت (%(start_date)s) و تاریخ برگشت (%(end_date)s) اجاره محصول معتبر "
"نیست.\n"
" متأسفانه ما در آن روز از هفته تحویل‌ها و برگشت‌های اجاره را پردازش نمی‌کنیم.\n"
"            "

#. module: website_sale_renting
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/website_sale_renting/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Some of your rental products (%(product)s) cannot be rented "
"during the\n"
"            selected period and your cart must be updated. We're sorry for "
"the\n"
"            inconvenience.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            برخی از محصولات اجاره‌ای انتخابی شما (%(product)s) در طول دوره "
"انتخابی\n"
"            قابل اجاره نیستند و سبد خرید شما باید به‌روز شود. بابت این مسئله "
"\n"
"            پوزش می‌طلبیم.\n"
"        "

